// FS25 vehicle glass (vehicleShader, alpha-blended) 0x9A8652D9 - windscreens and side windows. The game's own DXIL,
// patched and reassembled (tools/fs25-decompiler/dxil-patch/patch_glass.py on fs25-tools):
//   - Glass Drops (CUSTOM_GLASS_DROPS): the game's waterDroplets code is gated by "uv.y > 0" which glass fails; with
//     drops on, wetness = max(vehicle wetness, global cWetness) without the UV gate and at
//     2x droplet density, so the game's droplet normals,
//     wet smoothness and highlights apply to glass. Droplet rims also raise alpha (premultiplied blend darkens
//     what is behind the rim, like a lens edge).
//   - addon.cpp makes pipelines using this shader double-sided (cull none) when Glass Drops > 0 at startup, because
//     many windscreens are single-sided and invisible from inside the cab.
